# Frontend EchoGuard

## Structure

- App Router under `echoguard/src/app/`
- Pages: `/` Live Analysis, `/call-history`, `/identities`, `/settings`, `/login`
- API client: `echoguard/src/lib/api.ts` → `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL`
- Auth: `auth-context.tsx` + `voxguard_auth_token` in localStorage
- Shell: `app-shell.tsx` + `sidebar.tsx`

## Conventions

- FastAPI calls use `API_BASE`; notification helpers often use relative `/api/notifications/*`
- Brand accent: `#F6821F`
- Risk states: `IDLE | SAFE | WARNING | CRITICAL`
- Soft auth exists (default operator); do not assume hard login gating unless changing that deliberately
- Prefer existing UI primitives in `components/ui/`

## Live Analysis

- Upload / record / live mic / text threat test live in `app/page.tsx`
- After analyze: `saveCall` then optional `triggerAnalysisAlert`
- Spectrograms: client preview (`AudioPreviewSpectrogram`) vs server evidence (`AnalysisEvidenceSpectrogram`)
